SPIKE, not shipped (2026-11-11): per-projection HTP matmul scales for FLUX.1 (NM_FLUX1_HTP_SCALE), built as dit/096 (CI
42844291012) to fix FLUX.1's stripes as dit/025 and dit/045 fixed fp16 overflows. Refuted on the S25: every projection at
1/32 rendered 59.0 dB from the unscaled picture at 1024² 20 steps (stripes the same), and matmuls on the CPU drew the same
texture at 512² (33.7 dB to the NPU's, error unstructured). Not an overflow. docs/IMPORTS.md, FLUX.1 stripes.

